  <name>Systemd User Task Manager</name>
  <summary>Systemdのユーザサービス、ユーザタイマーを管理するアプリケーション</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      This application provides a graphical interface to manage systemd user services and timers.
      It allows users to easily create, edit, enable, disable, and monitor their personal systemd units.
    </p>
  </description>
